report/campaign/logs-cache/

# RDO conformance git gate — per machine, written by `npm run conformance`
.conformance-gate.json

# Live RDO campaign — inter-agent exchange bus (report/plan-campagne-live-rdo.md §2).
# Deliberately at the repo root and NOT under src/: the conformance gate compares the
# newest mtime under src/ to the last replay+live runs, so an agent writing here would
# otherwise re-arm the gate and cost a live run on planitia for nothing.
.rdo-live/
